{"2462000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roboom", "steam_appid": 2462000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462000/extras/a6eefbcd32c126177ed08c0380090bd2.poster.avif?t=1743002741\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462000/extras/a6eefbcd32c126177ed08c0380090bd2.webm?t=1743002741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462000/extras/a6eefbcd32c126177ed08c0380090bd2.mp4?t=1743002741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Roboom</strong> is a fast-paced, top-down arena shooter where you fulfill your destiny as a fighter in a multiverse-sprawling war of minds. Battle against the evil Robocons, harness powerful upgrades, and rise to become the best Robocon of Vision!<br><br> In a universe not so far away from ours, beings known as Robocons once attempted to transcend the limits of their existence. This endeavor, however, transformed them into wicked creatures, eager to spread their Oblivion throughout the multiverse. A faction of resilient Robocons did not fall into the Oblivion, joining the ranks of the Holistic Union to defend the multiverse in an impending war of minds. Your destiny as a Robocon of Vision awaits you!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><li> Engage in fast-paced gameplay against hordes of enemies<br></li><li> Compete with Robocons all around the <span class=\"bb_strike\">multiverse</span> world via the leaderboard system<br></li><li> Team up with friends in local <strong>co-op</strong> up to 4 players, also supporting Remote Play<br></li><li> Invite all Robocons to action with the Twitch Integration, as companion or boss <br></li><l